.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_SECTION_GET 3
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_section_get
.Nd return a section handle by section-table index
.Sh LIBRARY
.Lb libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_section_t *
.Fn elf_section_get "const elfobj_t *obj" "size_t index"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn elf_section_get
function returns the section object at
.Fa index
in the section table of
.Fa obj .
.Pp
The returned pointer refers to storage owned by
.Fa obj
and remains valid while the object exists.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The
.Fn elf_section_get
function returns a non-null section pointer when
.Fa index
is in range.
It returns
.Dv NULL
if
.Fa obj
is
.Dv NULL
or if
.Fa index
is greater than or equal to the section count.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_section_count 3 ,
.Xr elf_section_addr 3 ,
.Xr elf_section 3
